Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:46.01,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Good evening, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.26,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,HKT48
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:48.94,Default,All,0,0,0,,Team H!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.28,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Team H's Mokugekisha show has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:59.36,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Everyone getting fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:06.13,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Amiyun and Mei-mei joined Team H after promotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:07.83,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,I said congrats, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:08.64,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.63,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Congrats, Mei-mei and Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.45,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,So first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:25.71,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,"Mokugekisha," "Zenjin Mitou,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:26.84,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,"Ibitsu na Shinju,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:28.31,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,"Akogare no Pop Star"—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:30.51,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,four songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:33.21,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Now we'd like to take the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:34.41,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Camera operator,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:38.00,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.77,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Seventh gens in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:46.46,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:47.57,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:48.44,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:50.06,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,The camera's close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.87,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Should I step back a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:53.90,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,They say it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.60,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:00.70,Default,Multiple,0,0,0,,H!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:03.01,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.86,0:19:09.34,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.01,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,And Amiyun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:12.10,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Mokugekisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:13.52,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Mokugekisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.30,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Last one...Panz! (Yuipan)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:24.93,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Yuipan's in a new position today, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:25.61,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Ah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.09,0:19:27.79,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.05,0:19:31.29,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,Everyone, squeeze in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:44.74,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,What's that voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:50.03,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,An unexpected voice there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:56.40,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,This photo will be sold in the lobby after the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.72,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,so please stop by on your way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:19:59.66,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:02.20,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:09.37,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Now let us introduce ourselves one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:10.87,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Today's theme is:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:18.40,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,"The charm and highlight of today's show you should watch for."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.79,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Let's start with Hiiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:21.13,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:23.48,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,When I say "Super,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:26.14,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,please shout "Hero!" unbelievably loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.69,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Unbelievably loud—got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:30.43,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Bright like the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:31.97,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Hakata's Super—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.35,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:37.27,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka, 22 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.35,0:20:39.03,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,I'm Team H's Kitagawa Hiiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:40.07,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Hiiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:45.99,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,That was loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:48.55,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Today's show highlight is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:50.61,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:51.69,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:53.82,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,I'm happy, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:56.43,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,I wondered if saying "me" would fall flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.56,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,so I asked Reia,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:20:59.79,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I said 80% would fall flat, so drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:01.10,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Amazing, the 20%!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:02.77,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,That's what she said, but thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:07.14,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,It's me because, well, we went a long stretch without shows, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:10.88,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,And I really love singing and dancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:14.88,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,so among you fans, jump, jump—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:20.06,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,you might have the image that I move big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:26.50,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,With no shows, there was nowhere to unleash that power,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.72,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,so I was itching the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:30.92,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Finally shows were starting again,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:33.52,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,so I was super fired up from rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:36.88,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,I was dancing so hard I stomped on Sae-san's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:40.36,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,That's an incident!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:41.28,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,What the heck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:41.97,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Oh no, oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:43.62,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,This is a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:46.58,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Everyone, at choreography this size—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:47.95,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Hiiro-chan's far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.44,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Way too spread out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:52.82,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,You take up way too much room!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:55.34,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was unconsciously way too fired up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:57.14,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,so I'll watch out for the people around me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.09,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,and give it my all today!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.17,0:22:00.72,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Let's get really hyped today!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.77,0:22:01.65,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:04.33,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.41,0:22:06.31,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:08.00,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Pure, proper, beautiful—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:09.51,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I can play 30 instruments!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:11.43,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,The all-mighty Reiwa Princess Reia,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:14.18,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,from Kanagawa, 20 years old, I'm Yanase Reia!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.50,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Everyone, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:25.02,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,My hair got short!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.73,0:22:30.71,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Is it fresh? Me with short hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:31.87,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.27,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Is it cute? Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:35.02,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,I'm more used to seeing it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:35.64,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.69,0:22:37.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I kind of forgot it was long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:37.86,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:38.60,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,It was so brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.65,0:22:41.53,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Right, actually until recently it was long,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:44.00,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,and this is my first show with a bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.05,0:22:45.11,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,That's misleading!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:47.31,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,It was long until now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:49.59,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Only Amiyun's allowed to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:53.73,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was living with extensions in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:54.78,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I took them out already,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.83,0:22:56.89,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,but extensions are really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:22:59.42,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Even taking a shower is a struggle,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:01.32,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,blow-drying takes 30 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:05.30,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,and wringing out this hair before drying
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.38,0:23:06.80,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,is really hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.88,0:23:11.82,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,So every day I lived through a lot of hassle,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.90,0:23:13.70,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,and finally my hair is short,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.78,0:23:15.60,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,and my head feels so light now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.78,0:23:17.55,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,so I'll swing this light head,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:19.36,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,make my hair all fluffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:20.91,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,and dance my hardest today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:22.42,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Thank you for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.04,0:23:24.16,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:28.65,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Okay, when I point the mic,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.70,0:23:30.04,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,please say "Ibuki!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:33.04,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Ibu-ibu-ibu-ibu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:36.50,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:38.35,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,I'll blow a new wind into HKT!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:41.72,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,I love kickboxing, from Fukuoka, I'm Ishibashi Ibuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:45.08,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Ibuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:51.36,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,My biggest charm—I wondered what it might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:54.06,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,It's not "my biggest charm"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:55.75,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine, whatever you want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:24:01.20,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Of course, everyone—all the members were saying
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.28,0:24:05.16,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,that "Amiyun and Mei-mei" would probably overlap for everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.24,0:24:07.74,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,so let's think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:10.59,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,So far everyone's only talked about themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.64,0:24:14.58,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,So I even debated changing my MC,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:18.58,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,and I asked the internet, "What's my charm?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:22.47,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, that's been off this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.52,0:24:25.08,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,The MC theme isn't "my charm"!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.16,0:24:30.16,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,So the charm is me, but which part, I wondered,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.24,0:24:32.68,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,and when I asked, "What's my charm?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.76,0:24:36.36,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,it said: "Seems free-spirited, but surprisingly human—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.44,0:24:39.04,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,a lovable charm."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.34,0:24:46.18,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,But it also said I still don't really understand myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.26,0:24:51.02,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Not understanding yourself at 21 is kind of serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:57.56,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,so I want everyone to watch me so I can find my own charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.64,0:24:59.10,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Like, you sound down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.18,0:25:01.79,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have no idea what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.84,0:25:07.94,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Anyway, apparently it's a lovable charm, so I'll send everyone lovable power!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.36,0:25:10.58,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks again for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.96,0:25:15.31,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,This is hard to follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.88,0:25:17.19,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Yuuna-chan, nail it for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.24,0:25:18.67,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Don't "nail it for us" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.72,0:25:20.28,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Okay, HKT... no, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.58,0:25:23.84,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Leave that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.30,0:25:27.42,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Okay, HKT48 Team H's Yuuna, Yamauchi Yuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.54,0:25:28.52,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yuuna-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.32,0:25:31.91,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.34,0:25:36.90,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Today's show highlight is, well, me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.01,0:25:42.91,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,The other day I said goodbye to my wisdom teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.81,0:25:47.33,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,and my face was swollen to a shocking degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.41,0:25:49.73,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,My mom looked at my face
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.75,0:25:53.89,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,and it was so swollen she said "Huh? Who are you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.97,0:25:56.77,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,but today the swelling's safely gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:25:59.34,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.42,0:26:01.01,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,I made it in time, so I'll do my best—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:01.93,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:03.41,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Don't "glad you could make it" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.46,0:26:04.61,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,It wasn't some last-minute thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.66,0:26:06.47,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Yuuna-san, you still have a hole right here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.52,0:26:08.11,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,You don't need to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.38,0:26:11.08,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I have a hole too, so we match.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.16,0:26:13.79,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,You have one today, right? You got a tooth pulled, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.84,0:26:14.78,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Please be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:17.54,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Can I wrap up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:20.98,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,I'll perform with all my might.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.06,0:26:23.78,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,And let's all pay attention to Shibui's MC!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.29,0:26:25.34,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.05,0:26:33.96,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,I love cherry tomatoes, smiles, and laughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.01,0:26:35.68,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,I'll make everyone smile at everyone—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.73,0:26:36.86,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Don't show it, don't show it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.91,0:26:39.67,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking over me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.67,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Talk, talk, talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.75,0:26:44.34,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Okay! Cherry tomatoes, smiles, and laughter—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.73,0:26:47.85,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Just talk already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:49.12,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Ready, set—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.20,0:26:52.74,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,I love cherry tomatoes, smiles, and laughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.82,0:26:54.47,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,I'll make everyone smile at everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.52,0:26:55.25,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,so keep watching me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.30,0:26:58.64,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,From Tokyo, high school 3rd year, 17, I'm Shibui Mina!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:26:59.74,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.30,0:27:07.02,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,My charm is—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.10,0:27:08.70,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.12,0:27:11.44,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,A weird game of telephone has started!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:16.38,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Today is Amiyun and Mei-mei's first show since promotion, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:20.55,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,And at the concert MC the other day, I kind of messed with Amiyun-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.60,0:27:23.12,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,and she cried, Amiyun-chan did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.20,0:27:28.76,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,So I wondered if I'd done something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.84,0:27:29.55,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,That's so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:31.93,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Right, I wondered if I'd done something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.98,0:27:36.46,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,If I don't show lots of good sides, those tears—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.78,0:27:39.96,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,I feel like I can't make up for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.04,0:27:44.42,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Everyone's Japanese is getting weird during the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.34,0:27:47.87,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,These people were like that from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:50.70,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,So, so that Amiyun-chan more...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.32,0:27:55.91,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,from the start...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.96,0:27:57.86,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,through the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.94,0:27:59.54,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,to Amiyun-chan and Mei-mei,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.62,0:28:03.10,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,a kind senpai, a cool senpai—
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.29,0:28:05.25,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,The third row gets pretty tiring!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.33,0:28:06.61,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,It's way too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.69,0:28:09.68,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,I'll show that I'm a kind, cool senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.76,0:28:11.88,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,to my juniors and the members,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:12.87,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,and to all the fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:15.94,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,so people say "Shibui's great"—
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:16.58,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.83,0:28:19.45,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,so they say "nice."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:20.91,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,I'll do my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.99,0:28:22.89,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.29,0:28:25.21,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.29,0:28:26.59,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,It's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:31.09,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,My MC turn, which I thought would never come, has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:33.46,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Okay, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:36.49,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I've even forgotten my self-intro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.97,0:28:39.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Okay, the "A" in Aki is the "A" in Asura,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.09,0:28:40.30,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,but my heart is a Bodhisattva's.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.35,0:28:43.99,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Still in training, 27, I'm Aki, Toyonaga Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.20,0:28:50.10,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.18,0:28:50.53,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.61,0:28:54.15,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,the first row threw off my pace, so I'm worried from here on, but
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.20,0:28:55.06,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,still,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.22,0:28:59.62,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I think Amiyun and Mei-mei are today's highlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.10,0:29:02.70,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Well, finally—saying "finally" is odd, but
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.16,0:29:04.70,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,even within Team H,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.78,0:29:09.88,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I thought, we've got girls who are energetic but not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.30,0:29:12.12,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Mei-mei is, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:15.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,kind of the neat, gentle type,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.34,0:29:17.29,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and Amiyun is innocent, which is nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.34,0:29:19.42,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so I was looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.50,0:29:21.38,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Today I tried talking to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.46,0:29:22.54,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I was talking, but
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.62,0:29:26.56,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I can't easily find the timing to start a conversation myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:28.53,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so I finally got to talk to them today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.58,0:29:32.48,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,The other day I went on a solo trip to Yamaguchi,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.94,0:29:35.61,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so I told Mei-mei, "By the way, the other day I
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.66,0:29:36.95,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,went to Yamaguchi for two days, one night,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.00,0:29:38.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and when I said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.34,0:29:39.80,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,she went, "Huh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:42.71,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Then after that: "Huh? I saw it on social media,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.76,0:29:43.74,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.34,0:29:46.99,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Her interjection and conjunction were so off—
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.26,0:29:48.95,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,why was she surprised the first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.00,0:29:50.21,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I seriously don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.26,0:29:52.03,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,And then she kept giggling, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.08,0:29:54.85,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Right, after that she kept laughing to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.28,0:29:57.09,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,She was clutching her stomach laughing,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.14,0:29:58.14,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,at her own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.22,0:30:01.00,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And I thought, uh-oh, uh-oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:03.40,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,my last hope
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.48,0:30:05.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,is Amiyun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:09.80,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah, Amiyun really likes me a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:12.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and I felt eyes on me—Amiyun was looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.26,0:30:17.31,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,So I told Amiyun, "Mei-mei was like this," and she listened really seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.36,0:30:20.95,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,"Good, this girl is serious," I thought, and one second later, at the chocolate Mei-mei had,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.00,0:30:22.41,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,she went, "What's that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.71,0:30:27.82,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and totally ignored me. I thought, there's innocent and then there's this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.87,0:30:30.79,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,but I guess that's the makings of Team H.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.87,0:30:35.33,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Today I want to remember how it feels to hold everyone's reins.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.41,0:30:37.07,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you all for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.63,0:30:41.84,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,To come see everyone—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.89,0:30:42.47,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Ikuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.55,0:30:46.19,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,I love singing, I love dancing, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.27,0:30:49.93,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka, high school 1st year, 16, I'm Ikuno Rina!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.01,0:30:50.74,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.19,0:30:52.93,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Ikuno!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.01,0:30:53.69,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.02,0:30:58.68,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Today's highlight is my highlight:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.80,0:31:04.36,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,I turned 16 in August, and this is my first theater show at 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.59,0:31:09.36,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,16 is kind of grown-up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.41,0:31:14.95,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,So I want you to see me more grown than 15-year-old me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.03,0:31:18.94,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,and I think you fans have only been able to cheer out loud on tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.99,0:31:22.05,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,so will you cheer a lot today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.93,0:31:25.24,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:27.32,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you so much for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.98,0:31:33.98,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Okay, when I say "Ready, set," please say "Kokoha!"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.12,0:31:36.65,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Where is this place? Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.73,0:31:37.58,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Here we go—ready, set!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.63,0:31:38.67,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Kokoha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.47,0:31:40.45,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.54,0:31:44.36,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka, high school 3rd year, 18, I'm Fujino Kokoha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.20,0:31:48.60,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.51,0:31:52.55,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,My highlight for today's show:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.77,0:31:55.12,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,it's the members' first show in a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.19,0:31:57.72,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,so everyone's energy is probably a bit higher than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.77,0:32:01.25,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,This is definitely going to be a good show, and also,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.41,0:32:03.35,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,these two got promoted,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:06.87,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd act like a proper senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.97,0:32:07.79,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Way too scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.17,0:32:09.98,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Yeah, arm around the shoulder like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.03,0:32:11.55,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Scary, scary, scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:12.65,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,That's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.99,0:32:15.99,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,It's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.23,0:32:17.57,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Scary, scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.62,0:32:22.72,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,But so far I have been kind to the 7th gens,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.80,0:32:24.71,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,so, the 7th gens, just like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.76,0:32:26.41,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,how the two who got promoted
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.78,0:32:28.49,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,as they settle nicely into Team H!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.54,0:32:30.82,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,I want to keep watching over that!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.92,0:32:32.67,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Thank you for today, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.72,0:32:33.96,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.86,0:32:39.26,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,HKT48 Team H's Sae-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.34,0:32:40.48,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Kurihara Sae!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.30,0:32:44.20,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.12,0:32:48.32,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,My highlight for today's show:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.40,0:32:51.94,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Mei-mei and Amiyun have joined us,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.02,0:32:53.84,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,and Yuina isn't here today,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.92,0:32:58.48,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,but the even livelier Team H is the highlight, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.56,0:33:01.54,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Unlike Kokoha, I act like a proper senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.30,0:33:04.86,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,so today I did the two of them's makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.68,0:33:09.44,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Which one's the better senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.90,0:33:12.31,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Who's the better senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.70,0:33:14.94,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Sae-san, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.72,0:33:17.09,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,You can't pick on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.14,0:33:19.08,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,I thought, she can't pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.16,0:33:20.13,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Don't put her on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.18,0:33:24.30,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,I made Amiyun and Mei-mei's eyes all sparkly,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:26.43,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,so please pay attention to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:28.47,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,and of course pay attention to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.52,0:33:30.06,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:32.24,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Then let's all have fun today!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:33.14,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.40,0:33:40.13,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka, I'll drop into your dreams today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.18,0:33:44.18,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,Hakata's dream princess, now in my thirties—Mai-chan, Fuchigami Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.71,0:33:52.35,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,I tried saying it like I'm 20, and I, too—
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.43,0:33:55.46,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,Ikuno-chan turned 16 too, so she's grown-up, apparently, but
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.51,0:33:58.33,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,I've technically turned 30 too,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.53,0:34:02.69,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,so I want to be more grown-up, and I'm fired up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.77,0:34:05.48,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,Personally, while this theater was on a break,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.65,0:34:08.39,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,I got to go see lots of theater shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.47,0:34:10.21,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,like AKB48's theater,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.57,0:34:12.92,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,and I also got to go see lots of concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.97,0:34:15.92,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,so I feel I've added to my repertoire in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.97,0:34:18.61,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,More drawers means more storage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.05,0:34:23.39,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,So I'll do my best to open them all up for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.47,0:34:25.76,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,And so as not to lose to Amiyun-chan and Mei-mei,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.81,0:34:27.21,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,I'll do my happy best!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.29,0:34:29.00,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.62,0:34:36.53,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,When Yui points the mic, please say "mentaiko French bread" and "Yui-pan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.08,0:34:39.16,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,The bread Yui loves is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.86,0:34:43.33,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,The bread that loves everyone is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.25,0:34:50.29,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,Thank you! From Fukuoka Prefecture, 16 — Matsunaga Yui! Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.20,0:34:59.20,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,The highlight of this show is...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.41,0:35:02.03,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,Drrrrrrrrr...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.11,0:35:03.45,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:10.19,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,Ai-chii-san made me say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.02,0:35:12.56,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,No, no. I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.64,0:35:13.68,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Such confidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.76,0:35:14.80,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Such confidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.88,0:35:15.66,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.42,0:35:17.84,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,I never thought she'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.10,0:35:20.73,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,I'm shocked at how confident she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.78,0:35:22.30,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Which one is lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.38,0:35:23.19,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,It's Aichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.24,0:35:23.83,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.45,0:35:27.74,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Well, but I think that's exactly right,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.99,0:35:30.65,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,so I'll do my best with confidence in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.73,0:35:33.02,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,And I'll have fun with Mei-mei and Amiyun
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.07,0:35:34.13,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,and get hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.21,0:35:35.80,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.05,0:35:46.93,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,When I point the mark, please say "south," "south-facing," "southwest," and "sparkle" after my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.63,0:35:49.80,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,North, south, east, west—favorite direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.85,0:35:50.20,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,South!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.99,0:35:52.22,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,And for apartment hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.42,0:35:53.13,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,South-north!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.68,0:35:54.93,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,And for cute-girl hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.98,0:35:55.58,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Southwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.40,0:35:59.92,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Thank you! Hakata's Southern Cross, Mii-na, Nakano Minami!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.16,0:36:00.88,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Sparkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.46,0:36:02.64,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.01,0:36:12.05,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Today's show highlight is the 7th gen:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.13,0:36:16.25,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Yoshida Mei-chan and Ishikawa Mei-chan, the two of them joined Team H,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.47,0:36:18.09,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,and them joining
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.17,0:36:20.23,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,means there are more 7th gens.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.41,0:36:21.17,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Which means
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.25,0:36:27.23,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,the theater stage has become super fresh and energetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.49,0:36:29.89,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,But—oh, sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.07,0:36:32.15,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Awkward. That's awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.37,0:36:32.85,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.59,0:36:35.50,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,She looked around at the 7th gens.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.55,0:36:38.83,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Of course Aichi-san is super fresh and energetic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.91,0:36:40.38,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Thanks for the follow-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.77,0:36:45.05,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,But since two 7th gens newly joined,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.13,0:36:50.43,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,I want to be fresher and more energetic than any 7th gen and jump higher than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.51,0:36:52.22,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Please take care of us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.09,0:37:06.00,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, 14, Team H's Amiyun, Ishikawa Amiyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.45,0:37:08.35,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.09,0:37:13.32,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Today's highlight is—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.37,0:37:16.75,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I cut my hair recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.25,0:37:19.83,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I cut it from here to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.91,0:37:23.93,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Actually, this is my first show since I cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:27.80,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,And,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.88,0:37:30.88,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,you might recognize this—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.96,0:37:36.86,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,it's my first hair arrangement after promotion, from my long-hair days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.68,0:37:39.65,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,It's the hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.70,0:37:41.70,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,The bob version is really—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.69,0:37:43.98,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Wait a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.97,0:37:46.09,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,A proper script—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.65,0:37:48.24,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,she did that, she prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.65,0:37:49.27,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.02,0:37:54.18,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,She's nervous, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.58,0:37:55.49,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I forgot a bit, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.54,0:37:58.44,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,It's really nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.06,0:38:00.98,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,So while remembering
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.06,0:38:02.10,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,that nostalgia,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.44,0:38:04.88,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I'll swing my bob-version hair a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.96,0:38:06.04,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,and do my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.12,0:38:07.99,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,so I'd be happy if you spot me a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.04,0:38:09.48,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.98,0:38:11.20,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:17.43,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,When I ask a question, please answer "Mei-mei!"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.48,0:38:18.36,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.60,0:38:21.13,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Loves melon—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.21,0:38:21.97,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.05,0:38:23.05,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Always energetic—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.11,0:38:23.65,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.73,0:38:24.65,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Bright smile—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.73,0:38:25.43,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.60,0:38:26.02,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.07,0:38:29.89,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,From Yamaguchi, high school 2nd year, 17, Mei-mei, Yoshida Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.97,0:38:31.08,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.23,0:38:33.15,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.53,0:38:39.13,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Okay, my highlight for today is...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.22,0:38:41.19,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Um, it's kind of awkward to say myself, but
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.24,0:38:42.58,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,my face—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.08,0:38:43.76,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Put it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.04,0:38:45.84,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Aichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.26,0:38:49.56,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,I didn't say it! I didn't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.76,0:38:51.98,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,This is really, like, myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.06,0:38:52.54,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.56,0:38:56.25,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,There's a proper reason for this:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.30,0:39:01.12,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,today my senpai did my makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.56,0:39:03.66,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Aichi-san did it for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.74,0:39:06.96,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and Yuuna-san and Sae-san made up my face too,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.48,0:39:10.59,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,so I'd love to deliver that face to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.64,0:39:11.26,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.48,0:39:14.42,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Today is my first team show since being promoted,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.50,0:39:15.51,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,so I'll do my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:16.36,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.28,0:39:22.75,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.83,0:39:25.77,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Today too: safety first, health first, everyone's—
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.24,0:39:30.23,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,from Kanagawa, Ai-chii, Ichimura Airi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.00,0:39:40.90,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,The highlight: it's our first show in a while, and as the new Team
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.98,0:39:44.60,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,H, today is our first Mokugekisha show,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.68,0:39:48.40,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,so all of it is a highlight, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.48,0:39:53.20,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,the MC—when you say shows, it's the MC.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.28,0:39:57.16,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,But I think all of you fans haven't laughed enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.24,0:40:00.84,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,You know, during the time without shows, we members too
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.92,0:40:05.52,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,haven't talked enough, so today it'll probably run really long,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.70,0:40:07.66,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,I think, but
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.74,0:40:09.78,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,let's all talk a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.86,0:40:11.42,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,and you fans laugh a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.50,0:40:14.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,cheer a lot, and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.08,0:40:15.60,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Thank you for today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.08,0:40:17.60,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.68,0:40:22.10,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Sparkling eyes and round cheeks means—
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.26,0:40:26.74,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,In my right cheek, charm;
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.82,0:40:28.79,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,in my left cheek, power is packed!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.84,0:40:31.31,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Today too, I'll deliver power to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.26,0:40:35.26,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,From Nagasaki, 16,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.34,0:40:36.13,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,I'm Ryuto Ayane!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.18,0:40:37.77,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.69,0:40:48.91,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Today's show point is, Team H after so long, so I'm really excited, but
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.99,0:40:52.03,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Mei-mei and Amiyun newly came to H,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.67,0:40:55.72,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,and they were super nervous in the dressing room before the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.77,0:40:59.87,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Amiyun was so nervous she teared up a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.95,0:41:01.99,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,so I gave her a big hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.83,0:41:07.55,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,During today's show, to bring out Mei-mei and Amiyun's full smiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.05,0:41:09.95,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,I want to make them laugh a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.03,0:41:11.91,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.10,0:41:12.90,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.15,0:41:14.88,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,That was amazing, like a script line!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.93,0:41:15.95,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Let's make them laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.87,0:41:20.15,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Without shows we don't get to meet that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.23,0:41:21.52,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,and there weren't any shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.57,0:41:24.37,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,so my cheeks are full of power and charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.95,0:41:26.84,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Packed too full, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.89,0:41:28.61,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Hey, Aichi-san, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.69,0:41:31.54,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,There's a lot packed in,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.62,0:41:33.33,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,and I think everyone's a bit tired
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.38,0:41:35.22,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,from work and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.30,0:41:36.61,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,A bit tired, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.66,0:41:39.01,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Hey, Aichi-san, you're being a bit loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.12,0:41:40.85,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,I think you're a bit tired, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.90,0:41:42.48,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,So my—
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.56,0:41:44.55,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,the power I've stored up for the main show,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.60,0:41:45.99,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,I want to release a lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.04,0:41:47.28,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Everyone, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.36,0:41:49.06,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Thanks for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.24,0:41:51.22,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.52,0:41:54.06,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Okay, HKT48
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.17,0:41:57.99,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Team H's Mokugekisha show is brought to you by the members above!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.61,0:42:01.84,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Everyone, it's our first show in a while—can you cheer?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.12,0:42:06.25,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,How about it, are Mei-mei and Amiyun enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.30,0:42:08.32,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.40,0:42:10.10,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Seems not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.18,0:42:13.36,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Everyone, can you cheer as loud as Mei-mei and Amiyun?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.89,0:42:19.33,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,From here, various units take the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.41,0:42:19.94,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.82,1:03:25.69,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,"Ude wo Kunde," "Enjou Rosen," "Itoshisa no Accel," "Hoshi no Mukougawa,"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.74,1:03:27.30,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,"Saboten to Gold Rush"—
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.38,1:03:31.36,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,five songs in a row. Everyone, having fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.44,1:03:33.56,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.64,1:03:34.58,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Yeahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.66,1:03:35.38,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.55,1:03:39.12,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Here we'd like to do the MC with these members, but
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.17,1:03:43.75,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,once again, Mei-mei and Amiyun, welcome
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.23,1:03:45.69,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,to Team H!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.62,1:03:54.28,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,And your first unit since promotion is "Saboten"!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.98,1:03:56.74,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,This one too—
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.37,1:03:59.25,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,you're the chosen ones,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.47,1:04:04.05,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,so I'd like to hear how you feel now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.19,1:04:07.08,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Since getting promoted, my first unit,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.13,1:04:09.45,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,my first unit was "Saboten,"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.53,1:04:13.57,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and I always wanted to try wearing this Saboten ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.45,1:04:16.76,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,so I was really happy. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.84,1:04:20.82,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Also, the 7th gens and me with Aichi-san—
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.42,1:04:25.90,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,That's right, a bit—
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.98,1:04:29.74,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,today I got thrown into an amazing spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.82,1:04:32.64,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Yeah, me, Aichi, with the 7th gens.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.72,1:04:33.42,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.50,1:04:35.81,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,But I really kind of like Aichi-san's Saboten.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.86,1:04:36.45,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,"Kind of"?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.19,1:04:42.39,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,So condescending!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.07,1:04:46.18,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,I meant "quite" as in "really"!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.18,1:04:46.77,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Thanks, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.27,1:04:51.06,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,So with Aichi-san in front,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.14,1:04:54.26,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,we got to do Saboten, and I was really happy today.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.34,1:04:55.94,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Wow, what a great junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.37,1:04:58.20,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Seriously amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.25,1:05:01.31,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Really? Yeah, fun, right? Amiyun, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.39,1:05:06.17,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I was really nervous from rehearsal, from the run-through,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.31,1:05:10.85,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,but the part where Aichi-san did "congrats on promotion,"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.93,1:05:15.41,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Aichi-san at rehearsal, "Aichi-san's the best." That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.49,1:05:16.24,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Oh no, oh no, oh no!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.29,1:05:17.88,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,I've been exposed, exposed!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.37,1:05:20.37,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Aichi-san, can I say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.45,1:05:23.30,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Today it was all 7th gens with Aichi-san in front—
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.35,1:05:24.84,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,in front, right? She's leading us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.89,1:05:28.63,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,She was so fired up from rehearsal, and when saying "7th gen,"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.71,1:05:34.01,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,like, "7th gen, 7th gen, 7th gen!" she was amazing,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.09,1:05:37.78,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,"It's Saboten, but here everyone does it like this,"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.86,1:05:40.52,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,she told us. And at rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.60,1:05:42.75,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,you know where we all do Saboten, and,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.80,1:05:46.39,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,me, Minami, and Yui thought it'd be like "7th gen, the best!"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.50,1:05:49.60,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,or "congrats on promotion," but from rehearsal—
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.86,1:05:51.31,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Aichi-san is the best!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.36,1:05:52.89,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,she was saying. Aichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.24,1:05:53.84,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.22,1:05:55.62,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,That's so like her!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.72,1:05:57.43,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,No, no, stop with "like her"!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.56,1:05:59.38,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Stop with "like her," hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.72,1:06:00.32,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.30,1:06:04.20,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,That was to put you at ease too!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.38,1:06:05.93,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.98,1:06:10.28,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,It really helped me. I was super nervous,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.40,1:06:12.76,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,but I burst out laughing at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.84,1:06:14.07,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,You laughed? Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.18,1:06:16.18,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,That's what I was hoping for.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.26,1:06:18.72,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,If you had fun with that, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.80,1:06:20.15,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,It's definitely, you know—
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.20,1:06:21.55,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,It's definitely not that she wanted to stand out.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.60,1:06:23.14,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Not true!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.62,1:06:26.68,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Not good! Not good! Not good!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.88,1:06:31.42,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,But I really felt the bond of the 7th gens,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.84,1:06:34.91,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,and I'm really glad I got to do it today with the 7th gen girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.96,1:06:35.55,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.98,1:06:37.55,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,"With the 7th gens," you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.60,1:06:38.53,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,"Together, 7th gen"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.58,1:06:39.96,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.66,1:06:44.10,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,There's MC too, so let's work hard on parts like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.18,1:06:45.47,Default,All,0,0,0,,We'll do our best, we'll keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.52,1:06:47.11,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Everyone, did you enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.81,1:06:52.95,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Shall we keep going from here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.03,1:06:55.56,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Will you let us hear your voices some more?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.75,1:07:01.40,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Next up, starting with this song. Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.34,1:18:55.14,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,"Utsukushiki Mono," "Ai wo Kure," "Matenrou no Kyori"—three songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.22,1:18:56.84,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Everyone, are you hyped?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.55,1:19:00.32,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.40,1:19:03.26,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Here we'd like to talk with these members.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.65,1:19:09.63,Default,Member,0,0,0,,It's been a while, so it's kinda fun, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.37,1:19:14.09,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,So first— oh, Sae-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.81,1:19:19.95,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Today, backstage, something made me go "Hm?"
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.19,1:19:25.27,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Ibuki was really down.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.51,1:19:28.75,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,When I asked, "Ibuki, what's wrong?"
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.45,1:19:34.33,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Ibuki said, "At the old theater, everyone laughed at whatever I said,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.41,1:19:37.87,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,but maybe everyone has a blank, because nobody laughs at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.93,1:19:40.37,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Everyone's no good," she was saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.33,1:19:43.97,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,But hearing the call during "Matenrou" just now,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.03,1:19:48.09,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,I was like, "The one with the blank isn't everyone, it's you, Ibuki!"
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.55,1:19:50.19,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,That's how Ibuki sees it, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.25,1:19:54.11,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,The way I see it, I really wasn't saying anything special,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.19,1:19:56.33,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,just one little remark,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.85,1:20:02.67,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,and for about the last month, anything I said got a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.75,1:20:03.49,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Ibuki!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.99,1:20:05.87,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Even this got everyone laughing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.23,1:20:09.25,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Even this, really, really, everyone did.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.33,1:20:12.83,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,So I was like, "Wow, Ibuki's gotten really funny."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.91,1:20:15.37,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,But somehow, today's different?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.51,1:20:17.16,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Nobody laughs for me at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.79,1:20:19.55,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Backstage she was blaming everyone big time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.61,1:20:20.09,Default,Member,0,0,0,,But is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.15,1:20:22.13,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Huh? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.21,1:20:24.27,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,See, they can cheer this loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.55,1:20:26.13,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Everyone hasn't changed, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.19,1:20:28.65,Default,Member,0,0,0,,If anything, they were amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.73,1:20:29.93,Default,Member,0,0,0,,The call was amazing too.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.99,1:20:33.01,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,So I've stopped being funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.09,1:20:34.95,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Either that, or—
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.03,1:20:37.73,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,you've just been spoiled until now, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.35,1:20:40.41,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Isn't that harsh, at the very end?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.75,1:20:45.93,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Well, in just a few days you'll leave this warm place
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.01,1:20:48.01,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and be released into the wild,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.90,1:20:51.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so everyone thought you can't go out like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.74,1:20:55.18,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Right, everyone taught you how harsh the world is.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.36,1:20:57.44,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Is that what it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.50,1:20:59.74,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Because Ibuki was bragging to Aichi and others,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.80,1:21:02.62,Default,Member,0,0,0,,"Wow, today's MC was all Ibuki's again," stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.68,1:21:04.02,Default,Member,0,0,0,,You always say that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.08,1:21:05.08,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I always used to say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.14,1:21:08.60,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Today I get so few laughs I don't even want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.68,1:21:11.85,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Okay then, Ibuki-san, for now I'd like to hear Amiyun-chan's story.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.91,1:21:12.51,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.86,1:21:16.83,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Is that okay? Can we go to Amiyun-chan's turn?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.89,1:21:17.81,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.89,1:21:18.57,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Let's see you try.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.63,1:21:23.13,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,So, Amiyun-chan, it's your first show since promotion—how is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.61,1:21:25.73,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Um, I'm super nerv—
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.81,1:21:28.05,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Wait, Hiiro-san just tossed it to her!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.34,1:21:31.85,Default,Member,0,0,0,,We want to hear Amiyun's story!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.93,1:21:32.71,Default,Member,0,0,0,,We want to hear it first!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.77,1:21:34.77,Default,Member,0,0,0,,We want to hear from Amiyun first.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.90,1:21:39.82,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Today is my first show since being promoted, and I was super nervous,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.92,1:21:44.34,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,but before the show, Sae-san put sparkles around my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.42,1:21:50.34,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,and so much sparkly power came in through my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.42,1:21:51.60,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I'm super nerv—
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.58,1:21:54.88,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,So that's why you were crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.94,1:21:55.86,Default,Member,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.92,1:21:57.32,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Please don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.54,1:22:00.92,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Don't tell them she was crying before the show!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.98,1:22:04.62,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Huh, wasn't it the glitter Sae-chan put on that got in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.68,1:22:05.16,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.24,1:22:06.53,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Is that why you cried?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.21,1:22:08.21,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,No, I put it on after she cried.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.27,1:22:09.99,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,So why did you cry?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.89,1:22:12.85,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Simply... because.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.91,1:22:13.73,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Tough question.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.79,1:22:15.95,Default,Member,0,0,0,,You got nervous, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.03,1:22:16.97,Default,Member,0,0,0,,You got nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.09,1:22:20.07,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Since she was nervous,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.13,1:22:22.43,Default,Member,0,0,0,,I hugged her before the unit song.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.41,1:22:26.53,Default,Member,0,0,0,,I was really nervous too, my first time going out,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.61,1:22:28.79,Default,Member,0,0,0,,so when I said, "Let's do our best,"
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.87,1:22:30.77,Default,Member,0,0,0,,she said, "Thank you very much."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.85,1:22:32.47,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Am I her senpai?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.55,1:22:33.67,Default,Member,0,0,0,,You're the same gen, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.73,1:22:36.11,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Did she really say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.28,1:22:38.70,Default,Member,0,0,0,,"Thank you very much," just like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.78,1:22:40.21,Default,Member,0,0,0,,I was that nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.29,1:22:41.31,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Super nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.55,1:22:45.73,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Okay, can I go? There's one thing I'm curious about.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.81,1:22:50.35,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Did you all know that Amiyun really loves Reia?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.43,1:22:51.03,Default,Member,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.75,1:22:56.87,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,And in parallel, at the same time, I guess—you like Aki-san too, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.95,1:23:02.01,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,I hear you say "I love her," so, um, whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.84,1:23:07.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Then, Amiyun, come to the middle. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.26,1:23:09.71,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Amiyun, come here, to the middle.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.79,1:23:11.87,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Come on, you're the star, so come to the middle.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.93,1:23:14.28,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Okay, so Reia and Aki, close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.36,1:23:14.84,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.92,1:23:15.52,Default,Member,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.00,1:23:18.00,Default,Member,0,0,0,,It's appeal time!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.33,1:23:20.37,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,I don't want you two to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.43,1:23:23.55,Default,Member,0,0,0,,The result too?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.54,1:23:25.15,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Us too?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.23,1:23:27.07,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Got it, got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.15,1:23:29.13,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,That way one of us gets hurt,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.21,1:23:31.39,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so first have her say one thing she likes about each,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.45,1:23:32.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and then give the result.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.15,1:23:34.85,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Then let's go with zero reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.91,1:23:37.55,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,So first, starting with Reia-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.63,1:23:38.53,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Reia-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.79,1:23:41.32,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,What do you like about Reia?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.38,1:23:43.12,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Reia-san, um,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.20,1:23:48.50,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,when I'm down to the absolute limit, she comes and comforts me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.80,1:23:49.40,Default,Member,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.36,1:23:53.04,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,And Aki-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.12,1:23:56.02,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Aki-san spoils me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.40,1:23:58.94,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.00,1:24:01.32,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Now, you two, please turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.98,1:24:03.98,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Wait, I can tell from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.78,1:24:06.24,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I can tell from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.30,1:24:06.96,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I'll close my eyes too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.02,1:24:09.24,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,If it's Aki-chan, then like this—
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.42,1:24:12.14,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,You mean which one I like more?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.20,1:24:13.86,Default,Member,0,0,0,,We're past names now, so—
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.94,1:24:15.72,Default,Member,0,0,0,,if you're going to say a name—
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.52,1:24:18.24,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I want to go out, just the two of us—
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.30,1:24:19.77,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,No reason from me either?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.90,1:24:20.50,Default,Member,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.12,1:24:22.24,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Just one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.70,1:24:24.99,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Then hide the name and give the reason?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.72,1:24:26.32,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.04,1:24:28.58,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.64,1:24:32.60,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,If I hide the name, it'll give it away,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.68,1:24:34.18,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,so can I just point?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.34,1:24:38.52,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Reia! She said Reia!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.70,1:24:41.82,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Ah, here comes the second half! Second half!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.90,1:24:43.72,Default,Member,0,0,0,,It's Reia! That was scary, huh! She said Reia!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.78,1:24:45.07,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Are they here already?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.10,1:24:47.20,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And I even comforted you...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.20,1:24:48.44,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.10,1:24:52.69,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Hold on, what do you mean? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.82,1:24:53.98,Default,Member,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.64,1:24:56.10,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,What kind of ending is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.16,1:24:56.98,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Huh? That surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.04,1:24:58.44,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,What a sloppy way to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.50,1:24:59.36,Default,Member,0,0,0,,That surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.42,1:25:01.24,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Like they were running away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.45,1:25:05.07,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that means the second-half group has started.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.13,1:25:08.60,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Now the second-half group will carry on with these members.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.21,1:25:13.03,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Mei-mei, welcome to H!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.11,1:25:15.73,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.81,1:25:16.62,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.70,1:25:17.40,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.57,1:25:21.69,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,She just got promoted to H, and this is her first show, but
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.75,1:25:23.89,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,at the huddle before the show,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.05,1:25:26.21,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,she was nervous and stiff as a board,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.27,1:25:30.21,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,her face was pale, and I wondered if she was okay,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.29,1:25:32.70,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,but she's finally getting her color back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.99,1:25:34.81,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm getting it back a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.61,1:25:38.73,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,I was promoted back in September,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.11,1:25:42.65,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,but today is my first time doing a team show like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.73,1:25:46.17,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,so it hadn't really sunk in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.27,1:25:49.63,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,But from around today's rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.15,1:25:55.47,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,my senpai asked me, "Mei-mei, is there anything else you want to do?"
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.55,1:26:00.05,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and in the dressing room too, like, "Mei-mei, are you good at drawing?"
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.53,1:26:02.24,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Like a transfer student, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.99,1:26:06.23,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, the way they welcomed me made me really happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.31,1:26:12.19,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and it's finally sinking in that I'm part of the team. I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.27,1:26:13.17,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.91,1:26:16.25,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Speaking of that, before the show,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.71,1:26:18.37,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Yuuna-chan, Sae-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.45,1:26:22.57,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Aichi-san and others were doing this amazing makeup on Mei-mei's face,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.81,1:26:27.11,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,like, "Today's her first show since promotion, it's a milestone,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.17,1:26:30.70,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,so more blush, and layer it, layer it, put in some glitter."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.04,1:26:35.12,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Even I've never had makeup like that done, so I was jealous.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.74,1:26:37.68,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,We figured you were fine, Shibui.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.29,1:26:42.19,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,But you know, I thought, "Mei-mei's fast."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.42,1:26:44.32,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Like, she's already looking down on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.38,1:26:45.40,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.16,1:26:47.14,Default,Member,0,0,0,,That's bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.22,1:26:49.88,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Here and there she looks down on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.96,1:26:52.14,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Seriously? She's a 3rd gen, you know!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.38,1:26:53.72,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.80,1:26:55.82,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Today too, it was like, "Hey, something-something, right?"
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.88,1:26:56.62,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Ah— no—
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.86,1:26:58.66,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Ehhh?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.28,1:26:59.92,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.98,1:27:02.74,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Um, Yui was close by.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.82,1:27:05.26,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, Yui-pan was near me,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.34,1:27:07.94,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and I thought she'd come next to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.33,1:27:09.76,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,I was writing on a board,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.82,1:27:12.56,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,"Hey, can you read this?" I asked,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.64,1:27:14.29,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and it was, like, Yuuna-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.94,1:27:16.05,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Yuuna-san!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.13,1:27:18.41,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but I joined before you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.47,1:27:19.81,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.87,1:27:21.97,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,I thought, "She's fast."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.05,1:27:24.43,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,But I did properly say "I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.85,1:27:28.31,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine, you can tease me all you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.39,1:27:30.07,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,But I've got a looked-down-on story too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.13,1:27:30.91,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Huh, huh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.97,1:27:32.11,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,No, that—
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.19,1:27:35.43,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Mai-chan, that's not something to say with a big smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.04,1:27:37.64,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,For me, it's not Mei-mei,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.94,1:27:38.90,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,it's Fujikoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.32,1:27:39.92,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.92,1:27:44.86,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,This one always looks down on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.78,1:27:47.58,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,We were doing a tour in the summer, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.64,1:27:49.32,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,We still are, and back then,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.40,1:27:52.40,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,at rehearsals, Team H often stood by together,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.48,1:27:55.38,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,and once when we were all together, from diagonally behind,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.44,1:27:58.68,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,I said, "Let's go eat sometime!" and she went, "Sure."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.74,1:28:03.34,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.56,1:28:07.82,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Scary, scary, scary! That's scary!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.20,1:28:10.98,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Sorry for my fellow gen-mate!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.38,1:28:12.98,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Look who's talking!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.08,1:28:15.42,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Wait, what was she feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.50,1:28:17.68,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Without an excuse, that's honestly scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.74,1:28:19.14,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,What was going through her head?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.20,1:28:20.12,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.54,1:28:25.76,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,It's my fault, but I got talked to all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.84,1:28:29.04,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,I was mixed in with everyone gathered, and she talked to me—
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.10,1:28:30.58,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,you thought it was some 6th gen, right? Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.64,1:28:31.40,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.48,1:28:32.76,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,But taking this chance—
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.82,1:28:34.44,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,"Taking this chance" nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.50,1:28:36.56,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,It's not "taking this chance, let's talk casually"!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.62,1:28:40.20,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,But really, the other day, the two of us went out, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.28,1:28:41.00,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.08,1:28:42.10,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,We did!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.18,1:28:43.26,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,She invited me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.34,1:28:44.94,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,She invited you, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.02,1:28:45.94,Default,Member,0,0,0,,You two, definitely too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.00,1:28:47.58,Default,Member,0,0,0,,Definitely, with this momentum.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.64,1:28:48.52,Default,Member,0,0,0,,True, true.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.60,1:28:51.94,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,By the way, when you went with Fujikoko, did she let you go home?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.00,1:28:53.53,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,We went to a second place.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.40,1:28:55.02,Default,Member,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.10,1:28:58.06,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,We had beef tongue— then we went to a café.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:01.62,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,But Mai-san was pretty into it,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.50,1:29:03.50,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.32,1:29:06.84,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,No, no, I mean it made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.34,1:29:09.50,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,No, the polite version: "I was happy."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.56,1:29:10.89,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Let's go again, Mai-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.95,1:29:11.55,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.67,1:29:12.77,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.85,1:29:14.61,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,She's kinda talking down, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.99,1:29:16.65,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.73,1:29:19.19,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,There was a time Fujikoko-san made me go "Ooh!"
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.25,1:29:20.91,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,I was drawing on a board,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.99,1:29:22.29,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,and I drew a cute picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.35,1:29:25.19,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Then Fujikoko-san praised me, "That's good!"
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.67,1:29:27.59,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,And when I said, "Fujikoko-san praised me!"
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.65,1:29:29.71,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,she went, "Aren't I a good senpai?"
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.39,1:29:34.23,Default,Member,0,0,0,,A bit scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.55,1:29:36.31,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Mei-mei, there are senpai like this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.37,1:29:37.91,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Can you make it in Team H?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.01,1:29:39.77,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,There are all kinds of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.31,1:29:40.96,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Any excuse?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.51,1:29:42.80,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,No, well, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.01,1:29:46.36,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Well, what I said was just a hint, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.03,1:29:50.68,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Mei-mei, don't let senpai like this be a bad influence on you,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.81,1:29:51.93,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.01,1:29:53.67,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Let's get along, okay, all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.73,1:29:56.49,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Let's all happily go on to the next, final song.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.55,1:29:58.37,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Everyone, please come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.27,1:30:09.80,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Next is the last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.88,1:30:12.00,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Please listen: "Inochi no Imi."
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.14,1:37:05.34,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Good evening, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.00,1:37:10.70,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Our first Mokugekisha show in about three months!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.91,1:37:12.91,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Is everyone having fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.66,1:37:21.06,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Today, two members promoted on September 1—
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.16,1:37:25.16,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Ishikawa Amiyu and Yoshida Mei—
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.17,1:37:27.17,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,are in their first Team H show!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.61,1:37:35.61,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,"Remembering what I learned as a trainee,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.06,1:37:40.16,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,I'll learn from my seniors and peers and grow."
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.62,1:37:42.62,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,That was Amiyun's pledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.12,1:37:47.12,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Mei-mei brings smiles at concerts and events,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.12,1:37:53.42,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,and today marks 555 days of daily SHOWROOM streams.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.63,1:37:56.54,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,With these two joining Team H,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.62,1:38:00.23,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,I hope they bring new colors to the team.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.53,1:38:10.13,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,We'll use the usual encore chant today,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.15,1:38:16.45,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,but please send them warm words at the send-off or on social media.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.75,1:38:25.15,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,To our two new members' success,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.16,1:38:27.32,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,and Team H's future,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.54,1:38:32.16,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,and HKT48's continued growth—
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.42,1:38:34.42,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,All right, let's call for an encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.00,1:50:01.22,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,"Zutto Zutto"—two songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.30,1:50:02.77,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.92,1:50:04.51,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.62,1:50:10.64,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Now, from here,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.72,1:50:12.37,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,we'd like to hear impressions of the show.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.42,1:50:14.34,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Aki-san, Aki-san, Aki-san!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.42,1:50:17.06,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Aki-san, you made a mistake, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.40,1:50:22.48,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,It wasn't a mistake—I honestly didn't remember it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.16,1:50:28.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I blanked, went "uh-oh," and the lyric I remembered was "I don't remember."
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.18,1:50:30.32,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,"I don't remember"!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.56,1:50:35.51,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Like this, even when the captain puts her body on the line and slips up,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.56,1:50:38.78,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I want to prove we're a group that can recover.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.86,1:50:39.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.52,1:50:43.62,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Good at excuses!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.66,1:50:46.61,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,What a nasty gesture.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.36,1:50:48.54,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,That's rare, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.62,1:50:49.36,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,It's rare!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.44,1:50:51.41,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,See, because nobody laughs like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.46,1:50:52.44,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.85,1:50:55.09,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I won't talk anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.67,1:50:56.25,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Talk!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.33,1:50:59.19,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,There were times we really felt the blank,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.27,1:51:02.69,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,but in spirit, everyone put across all they could,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.77,1:51:06.35,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and I'd like to hear impressions of that show.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.43,1:51:08.58,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Today I'll ask the two who got promoted.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.63,1:51:10.03,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,So first, Amiyun.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.86,1:51:12.98,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Amiyun, Ishikawa Amiyun here!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.44,1:51:22.64,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming, for coming, and for watching on DMM tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.60,1:51:24.08,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.16,1:51:27.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Since everyone will watch too.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.02,1:51:33.76,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Okay, so today was my first Mokugekisha show as Team H,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.84,1:51:39.88,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,and I was really, truly nervous, and also excited and thrilled,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.96,1:51:43.82,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,but until last night I felt like, just nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.90,1:51:49.72,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,No thrill, but excited, kind of a confusing feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.90,1:51:50.93,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,You'd reached enlightenment.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.98,1:51:51.74,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.00,1:51:57.24,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,But at the huddle right before the show it peaked and I got nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.16,1:52:02.28,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Yeah, Aki-san's talk at the huddle made me the most nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.36,1:52:02.74,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Was it long?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.79,1:52:03.56,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.74,1:52:06.95,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,That's why I forgot the lyrics, talking that long!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.00,1:52:11.92,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,No, Aki-san's words made me think I had to do my best,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.12,1:52:16.76,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,and really brought my feelings back,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.24,1:52:20.42,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I was really nervous, but
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.50,1:52:22.92,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Team H-style, Saboten—
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.04,1:52:26.06,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,for units I got to do "Saboten to Gold Rush,"
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.14,1:52:31.76,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,and I could perform really Team H-like,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.84,1:52:33.05,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,so it was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.10,1:52:34.75,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for today!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.94,1:52:36.08,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.60,1:52:40.76,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,So Team H-ness is Saboten, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.90,1:52:41.52,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.46,1:52:43.47,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Everything put together.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.52,1:52:44.91,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,It's condensed in there, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.96,1:52:45.24,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.92,1:52:48.08,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And Mei-mei?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.10,1:52:50.86,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm Mei-mei, Yoshida Mei.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.22,1:52:58.68,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Everyone who came here today,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.76,1:53:00.44,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and everyone watching too,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.52,1:53:01.60,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.08,1:53:09.60,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Since I performed as an understudy,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.68,1:53:10.97,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,I'd been thinking a little:
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.02,1:53:13.04,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,everyone in Team H really,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.12,1:53:13.91,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,how do I put it,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.96,1:53:15.14,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,individuality, or
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.72,1:53:18.30,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,each and every one—
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.68,1:53:21.65,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Just now she slipped it in like air—
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.70,1:53:22.84,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,she said "cute"!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.92,1:53:23.30,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.35,1:53:24.00,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.08,1:53:26.32,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,really, truly,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.40,1:53:26.96,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,each one,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.04,1:53:29.59,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,such individuality
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.67,1:53:30.79,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,comes through,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.42,1:53:35.46,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,so as not to lose to that,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.54,1:53:38.72,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,I want to bring out a new color for Team H,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.80,1:53:40.98,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,and I'll work hard from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.06,1:53:42.71,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for today!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.22,1:53:49.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I think it came through plenty, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.74,1:53:51.60,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Adding Yuina-chan here,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.00,1:53:55.86,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,the 17 of us is for a limited time, but we'll all do our best
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.94,1:53:59.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,to have fun and give you fun, so please support us.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.86,1:54:02.56,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And—
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.66,1:54:05.86,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,We have a surprise for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.10,1:54:10.60,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,It's a seat-number lottery!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.89,1:54:18.49,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,That big "ooh" made me so nervous, though!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.87,1:54:22.62,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so all 16 of us drew lots,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.70,1:54:26.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and for the seat numbers the members call,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.40,1:54:29.22,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,signed cheki—
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.60,1:54:32.78,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,we'd like to give them to you, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.66,1:54:36.37,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Okay, first,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.82,1:54:38.80,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Starting with Amiyun...come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.88,1:54:39.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,A line, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.76,1:54:41.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Let's make a line.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.50,1:54:42.50,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Line up, line up.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.96,1:54:44.86,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,We have a custom here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.66,1:54:48.60,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,First, please check your seat number.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.68,1:54:50.06,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Please check it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.78,1:54:52.72,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,If your number is called,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.80,1:54:54.56,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,raise your hand and say "Yes!"
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.68,1:54:57.68,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,They're in—definitely draw it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.76,1:54:58.17,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.54,1:54:59.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Reliable!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.02,1:55:00.81,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.16,1:55:01.82,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Okay, going.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.84,1:55:04.88,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.20,1:55:07.39,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,Seems to be at the draft meeting!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.44,1:55:10.40,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Row 3, number 5!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.48,1:55:11.21,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Row 3!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.50,1:55:23.00,Default,Nakano Minami,0,0,0,,Next one—row 11, number 15!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.00,1:55:27.58,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Nice reply! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.66,1:55:28.72,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.28,1:55:34.28,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,0,,Row 1, number 13!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.98,1:55:41.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching me!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.26,1:55:42.54,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Are your legs okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.45,1:55:48.08,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Okay, row 12, number 6!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.16,1:55:50.88,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Everyone—ooh, a great reply!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.56,1:55:52.16,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.57,1:55:57.63,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Row 4, number 17!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.27,1:56:02.47,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Nice
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.40,1:56:13.66,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,0,,No, no—standing area, row 3, number 4!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.55,1:56:15.61,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Number 4!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.57,1:56:19.05,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.13,1:56:20.25,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.63,1:56:27.25,Default,Ryuto Ayane,0,0,0,,Row 9, number 24!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.67,1:56:29.69,Default,All,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.53,1:56:31.61,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.92,1:56:33.76,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Alright, then—
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.84,1:56:36.61,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Row 2, number 6!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.79,1:56:43.69,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.88,1:56:48.78,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,0,,Standing, row 2, number 5!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.86,1:56:49.84,Default,Multiple,0,0,0,,Number 5!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.92,1:56:51.86,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Are they here? Are they here?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.52,1:56:53.78,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I told you to check
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.86,1:56:55.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,your seat number!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.54,1:56:57.42,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.48,1:56:58.42,Default,All,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.22,1:57:03.11,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I told you to check your seat number!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.16,1:57:04.13,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,I said that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.18,1:57:05.88,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Don't they get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.96,1:57:09.26,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,For mine, say "Yes!" properly in a big voice!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.34,1:57:10.12,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,So strict!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.20,1:57:12.58,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,0,,Row 7, number 15!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.84,1:57:15.88,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Not here?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.00,1:57:16.78,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Not here?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.18,1:57:18.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Everyone's pointing!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.00,1:57:21.96,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,So they're here!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.04,1:57:27.84,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I told you to check your seat number!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.08,1:57:33.56,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Going!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.41,1:57:36.87,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,Row 9, number 27!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.95,1:57:38.13,Default,All,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.21,1:57:39.85,Default,All,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.45,1:57:49.29,Default,Shibui Mina,0,0,0,,Row 4, number 12!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.37,1:57:50.63,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,0,,Row 4, number 12!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.71,1:57:55.49,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,Okay, done!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.57,1:57:58.30,Default,Fuchigami Mai,0,0,0,,Row 2, number 19!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.20,1:58:08.00,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Row 10, number 14!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.20,1:58:19.00,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Row 10, number 5!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.00,1:58:25.30,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Okay, drawing the last one!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.10,1:58:33.00,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Row 13, number 18!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.00,1:58:39.50,Default,All,0,0,0,,Congrats! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.00,1:58:43.40,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,So, for all of you, at a later date—
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.54,1:58:44.51,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Not a later date!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.56,1:58:48.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,After this, the staff will guide you,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.26,1:58:50.86,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so please look forward to it. And so,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.94,1:58:52.54,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,that was the seat lottery!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.62,1:58:53.62,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.20,1:58:59.32,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.40,1:59:01.38,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,fun times fly by.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.46,1:59:04.24,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Really, our first show in a while—
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.32,1:59:09.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,the environment has changed a lot, and things may look different too,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.44,1:59:13.50,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,but still, the show we make with all of you
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.58,1:59:17.22,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,is a space—I really feel that.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.30,1:59:23.42,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I think you're all waiting, excited and nervous, to see how the new place turns out,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.50,1:59:28.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,but being able to have fun with you like this in this limited time
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.12,1:59:31.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,and build up memories makes me truly happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.44,1:59:35.64,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Please continue to support Team H and HKT48 from here on.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.72,1:59:37.60,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.86,1:59:46.20,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And so, next is the last song—
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.28,1:59:47.84,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,everyone, can you cheer?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.06,1:59:50.32,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.54,1:59:52.59,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Can you let out everything you've stored up?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.64,1:59:54.62,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.60,1:59:57.72,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Then please listen to the last song:
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.78,1:59:58.46,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,"Pioneer."
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.25,2:03:54.43,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.93,2:04:06.03,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,After this, to show our gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.15,2:04:08.49,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,we'll see you off.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.57,2:04:11.41,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Please wait where you are until staff guide you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.89,2:04:13.83,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Now, let's do our final greeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.39,2:04:17.35,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Ready, set—
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.83,2:04:20.22,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Amiyun-chan! Mei-chan!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.27,2:04:22.43,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,On your Team H promotion!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.85,2:04:24.29,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Ready, set—
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.37,2:04:27.25,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Congrats!!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.59,2:04:40.31,Default,All,0,0,0,,Congrats, you two!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.39,2:04:41.13,Default,All,0,0,0,,Congrats to you!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.03,2:04:45.21,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.95,2:04:49.54,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Thanks to everyone in the standing area too!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.93,2:04:51.90,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I could see you really feeling it!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.95,2:04:55.05,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,0,,I could see everyone in the studio too!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.13,2:04:56.19,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.83,2:04:59.42,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.11,2:05:18.53,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,And to everyone watching on DMM, thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.65,2:05:20.47,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you all!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.27,2:05:42.65,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Don't forget about tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.00,2:06:34.82,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Okay, you two, say something nice to wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.00,2:06:38.00,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Aki-san, that's not allowed!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.57,2:06:39.97,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,That's Team H.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.89,2:06:41.89,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I'll be watching.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.32,2:06:54.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,It's not after school, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.66,2:07:07.36,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Please wait a moment, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.59,2:07:10.52,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,After rehearsing that much, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.10,2:07:12.34,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.00,2:07:18.50,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.60,2:07:21.20,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything today!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.89,2:07:59.89,Default,Multiple,0,0,0,,That's the end of the show!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.34,2:08:03.14,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.39,2:08:05.39,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.14,2:08:09.04,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,It was my first team show since my promotion,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.40,2:08:10.20,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,It was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.30,2:08:13.00,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,But at today's show, again,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.11,2:08:15.33,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,Team H-san, Team H's—
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.41,2:08:16.35,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,everyone's—
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.09,2:08:18.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,you're "everyone" too!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.41,2:08:21.77,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,I found new wonderful things
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.85,2:08:23.49,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,about everyone in Team H,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.57,2:08:24.81,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,so I'll
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.89,2:08:27.09,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,0,,work hard not to lose!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.31,2:08:31.59,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,We'd like to go one by one, but—
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.67,2:08:32.67,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,how was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.27,2:08:39.87,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,I was really, truly nervous from start to finish,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.95,2:08:42.85,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,but everyone in Team H's—
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.12,2:08:49.02,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,smiles during songs, and behind the scenes, "you got this,"
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.10,2:08:52.58,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,those words really supported me.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.66,2:08:57.78,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,But it'd been so long since I used my voice that I couldn't talk well in the MC,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.86,2:08:58.53,Default,Unknown,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.73,2:08:59.90,Default,Ishikawa Amiyu,0,0,0,,so that's a bit of a regret.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.44,2:09:02.20,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Right, like you chose wrong—
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.28,2:09:03.64,Default,Ishibashi Ibuki,0,0,0,,Did you get it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.72,2:09:05.01,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,I didn't get it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.50,2:09:07.03,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,No, I didn't get it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.10,2:09:10.51,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I tried to show Amiyun my good side and went way too hard.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.46,2:09:12.37,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,0,,Okay, with this—
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.78,2:09:16.06,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.82,2:09:21.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,I won't worry about my relationship with Amiyun here from now on,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.76,2:09:24.76,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so please keep an eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.84,2:09:25.86,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,Mei-mei too—
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.54,2:09:30.24,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,today we already saw lots of her funny side.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.18,2:09:33.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,All her actions were weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.00,2:09:38.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,But if I say too much, you won't see it soon,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.78,2:09:42.14,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,so while we all discover that kind of thing,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.22,2:09:44.57,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,0,,we want to keep having fun with you all.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.00,2:09:50.59,Default,Multiple,0,0,0,,Look forward to our next show!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.85,2:09:55.27,Default,All,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.55,2:09:56.65,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
